              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഗുണമേന്മ (guṇamēnma) is a Malayalam compound built from ഗുണം, quality, from Sanskrit guṇa (CDIAL 4190), and the native word മേന്മ, excellence (DEDR 5086)."
