          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഉൽപ്പന്നം (ulppannaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit utpanna, \"risen, produced\" (Monier-Williams): what has been made."
