              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മായം ചേർക്കുക (māyaṁ cērkkuka) is a Malayalam verb phrase built from മായം, adulteration, usually traced to Sanskrit māyā, \"art, trickery\" (Monier-Williams), and the native verb ചേർക്കുക, to add (DEDR 2814)."
            }
